OL,3,ACanadian military base incident
OL,4,A'unheard of', mayor tells BBC after
OL,5,Amajor fire kills several
OL,6,
OL,7,FA local mayor says "this kind of
OL,8,Ftragedy is unheard of", after several
OL,9,Fpeople were killed in a large fire at a
OL,10,FCanadian military base in Alberta
OL,12,FThe fire is now contained, but rescue
OL,13,Fteams remain at the scene to prevent
OL,14,Fany potential flare-up, the mayor tells
OL,15,Fthe BBC
OL,17,FDetails are still unclear, but Canadian
OL,18,Fmedia report that at least seven were
OL,19,Fkilled and dozens more injured when a
OL,20,Fgas line or gas well was hit during a
OL,21,Flive-fire training exercise - here's
OL,22,Fwhat we know so far
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
